/A 1739 0 R
/Alt (Panel A shows a line graph comparing mean arthritis score over time after CIA immunization for two groups, PP MIX 150 mg/kg from Day 0 and from Day 23. Panel B presents a line graph of forelimb fold change over time post-CIA immunization for the same groups, with a decline evident in both. Panel C depicts a similar line graph for hindlimb fold change, showing decreasing trends. Panel D displays a bar graph of IL-17A concentrations, with both treatment groups lower than the CIA vehicle. Panel E presents four histological images of joint tissue: NO CIA, CIA-Vehicle, CIA-PP MIX from Day 0, and CIA-PP MIX from Day 23, showing apparent preservation of tissue in treated groups.)
